          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}21-(x+4)^2&=(\\sqrt{21})^2-(x+4)^2\\\\&=(\\sqrt{21}-(x+4))(\\sqrt{21}+(x+4))\\\\&=(\\sqrt{21}-x-4)(\\sqrt{21}+x+4)\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p34-q18-r",
        "type": "part",
