          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}19-(x-1)^2&=(\\sqrt{19})^2-(x-1)^2\\\\&=(\\sqrt{19}-(x-1))(\\sqrt{19}+(x-1))\\\\&=(\\sqrt{19}-x+1)(\\sqrt{19}+x-1)\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
